; ..\Appl\GenData\Dcm_Lcfg.c	    88   *                                    OUT: Concrete length of the dynamic response Signal
; ..\Appl\GenData\Dcm_Lcfg.c	    89   *  \param[out]    ErrorCode          Negative response code
; ..\Appl\GenData\Dcm_Lcfg.c	    90   *  \return        E_OK               The operation is finished
; ..\Appl\GenData\Dcm_Lcfg.c	    91   *  \return        DCM_E_PENDING      The operation is not yet finished
; ..\Appl\GenData\Dcm_Lcfg.c	    92   *  \return        DCM_E_FORCE_RCRRP  Forces a RCR-RP response
; ..\Appl\GenData\Dcm_Lcfg.c	    93   *                                    The call out will called again once the response is sent. The OpStatus parameter
; ..\Appl\GenData\Dcm_Lcfg.c	    94   *                                    will contain the transmission result
; ..\Appl\GenData\Dcm_Lcfg.c	    95   *  \return        E_NOT_OK           The operation has failed. A concrete NRC shall be set, otherwise the DCM sends NRC
